      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The author reviews the literature for the possible etiology and the conservative and surgical treatment alternatives for mechanically induced plantar heel pain. A long-term retrospective study on a plantar fascial release surgery performed on patients with recalcitrant plantar heel pain, all of whom were unresponsive to conservative therapy, is presented."},
